    tips: ['Arrive at least two nights before the eclipse.', 'Keep August 2 dedicated to the event.', 'Tour temples only in cooler early hours.', 'Separate confirmed viewing access from ordinary transport and accommodation.', 'Use August 3 as a recovery or disruption buffer.', 'Add a cruise or Aswan after the Luxor block when possible.'],
